      "mergedPostDetails": "a thing I frequently find myself doing in vr is finding a way to get onto an object that *should* be climbable, but its just above jump height.\n\nthats why Im asking/suggest a use/climb type commands if even just with the ability to hoist yourself to ledges with colliders. (this is a very niche small quality of life and immersion thing yes, but a small little action I find myself wanting a lot in vr situations)",
